^{:go/end 342} (go/method refreshPinnerBits "refreshPinnerBits replaces pinnerBits with a fresh copy in the arenas for the\nnext GC cycle. If it does not contain any pinned objects, pinnerBits of the\nspan is set to nil.\n" [^{:tag (* mspan)} s]
